{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141850/extras/54bbb7791fc9fa804ca151b30cf61f1a.avif?t=1769575126\" width=638 height=198 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of Riddledale is filled with fantastic creatures and wizards. Follow Wilburn on his homecoming journey after years abroad. Meet Ralph, your new companion, and embark on a quest to solve the riddle of the crystals. As he explores the island, Wilburn will soon discover that the place where he grew up changed during the years, and that a dangerous secret now lies under the island. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141850/extras/bd05fa92906198be2ec222779d65cf56.avif?t=1769575126\" width=638 height=198 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Riddledale is a new open-world adventure centered around story and characters. Solve riddles, make fun encounters and fight ferocious creatures on a vast island full of secrets. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141850/extras/e5ec10e1a8749e7c7d1140c880a019a1.poster.avif?t=1769575126\" width=600 height=152 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141850/extras/e5ec10e1a8749e7c7d1140c880a019a1.webm?t=1769575126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141850/extras/e5ec10e1a8749e7c7d1140c880a019a1.mp4?t=1769575126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Riddledale is filled with creatures and foes. You will need to be swift to defeat your enemies, but above all, you must be prepared. Rest well, plan your expeditions, and gather food and supplies before venturing forth. Combine your combat skills with Ralph's powerful spells to overcome your foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141850/extras/61a74e6750a6b0f66f7cf4f54227a3a5.poster.avif?t=1769575126\" width=600 height=152 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141850/extras/61a74e6750a6b0f66f7cf4f54227a3a5.webm?t=1769575126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141850/extras/61a74e6750a6b0f66f7cf4f54227a3a5.mp4?t=1769575126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Collecting resources is essential\u2014it allows you to brew potent potions, cook delicious meals, and craft powerful tools and weapons. Hone your crafting and gathering skills to unlock hidden quests and uncover unexplored locations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141850/extras/7e78ff68759dbc6dad47c05e0d999835.poster.avif?t=1769575126\" width=600 height=152 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141850/extras/7e78ff68759dbc6dad47c05e0d999835.webm?t=1769575126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141850/extras/7e78ff68759dbc6dad47c05e0d999835.mp4?t=1769575126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Riddledale is centered around storytelling. The world and characters evolve as the story progresses, as do your relationships with your friends. Dialogues and quests will guide you on your journey, but exploring the island freely will always lead to new, fun, and unusual encounters. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141850/extras/b8d50cc13c195bb71127c7fc2f94253f.avif?t=1769575126\" width=638 height=198 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Riddledale is a volcanic island in the middle of the sea, located between the western and the eastern continents. Ancient ruins from an extinct civilization still cover the island but its fall remains unsolved. In more recent years, the town of Riddledale has grown to become a prime touristic destination and its new mining operations are rapidly putting back the forgotten island on the maps. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141850/extras/f881351c6f87dee710e14b1e7daa33d3.avif?t=1769575126\" width=638 height=198 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit the official website to learn more about the game. Join the community and get a chance to participate in exclusive beta tests before release.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2141850?t=1769575126","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141850/b4b4709b782f15b66f2b0cc80636d62b8f17ceb3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769575126","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141850/a0598b098ee5ce7afa8c6769f6c5c4282eac0069/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769575126","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141850/a0598b098ee5ce7afa8c6769f6c5c4282eac0069/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769575126","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>Wishlist Riddledale on Steam\u2122</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't forget to Wishlist the game to be notified on release.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141850/extras/54bbb7791fc9fa804ca151b30cf61f1a.avif?t=1769575126\" width=638 height=198 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of Riddledale is filled with fantastic creatures and wizards. Follow Wilburn on his homecoming journey after years abroad. Meet Ralph, your new companion, and embark on a quest to solve the riddle of the crystals. As he explores the island, Wilburn will soon discover that the place where he grew up changed during the years, and that a dangerous secret now lies under the island. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141850/extras/bd05fa92906198be2ec222779d65cf56.avif?t=1769575126\" width=638 height=198 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Riddledale is a new open-world adventure centered around story and characters. Solve riddles, make fun encounters and fight ferocious creatures on a vast island full of secrets. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141850/extras/e5ec10e1a8749e7c7d1140c880a019a1.poster.avif?t=1769575126\" width=600 height=152 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141850/extras/e5ec10e1a8749e7c7d1140c880a019a1.webm?t=1769575126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141850/extras/e5ec10e1a8749e7c7d1140c880a019a1.mp4?t=1769575126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Riddledale is filled with creatures and foes. You will need to be swift to defeat your enemies, but above all, you must be prepared. Rest well, plan your expeditions, and gather food and supplies before venturing forth. Combine your combat skills with Ralph's powerful spells to overcome your foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141850/extras/61a74e6750a6b0f66f7cf4f54227a3a5.poster.avif?t=1769575126\" width=600 height=152 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141850/extras/61a74e6750a6b0f66f7cf4f54227a3a5.webm?t=1769575126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141850/extras/61a74e6750a6b0f66f7cf4f54227a3a5.mp4?t=1769575126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Collecting resources is essential\u2014it allows you to brew potent potions, cook delicious meals, and craft powerful tools and weapons. Hone your crafting and gathering skills to unlock hidden quests and uncover unexplored locations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141850/extras/7e78ff68759dbc6dad47c05e0d999835.poster.avif?t=1769575126\" width=600 height=152 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141850/extras/7e78ff68759dbc6dad47c05e0d999835.webm?t=1769575126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141850/extras/7e78ff68759dbc6dad47c05e0d999835.mp4?t=1769575126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Riddledale is centered around storytelling. The world and characters evolve as the story progresses, as do your relationships with your friends. Dialogues and quests will guide you on your journey, but exploring the island freely will always lead to new, fun, and unusual encounters. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141850/extras/b8d50cc13c195bb71127c7fc2f94253f.avif?t=1769575126\" width=638 height=198 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Riddledale is a volcanic island in the middle of the sea, located between the western and the eastern continents. Ancient ruins from an extinct civilization still cover the island but its fall remains unsolved. In more recent years, the town of Riddledale has grown to become a prime touristic destination and its new mining operations are rapidly putting back the forgotten island on the maps. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141850/extras/f881351c6f87dee710e14b1e7daa33d3.avif?t=1769575126\" width=638 height=198 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit the official website to learn more about the game. Join the community and get a chance to participate in exclusive beta tests before release.</p>","developers":["Catnip Lab"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141850/d07d42bc6e2273f29ef56ad49cf50dba69902667/header.jpg?t=1769575126","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"@2025 CATNIP-LAB. All Rights Reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</stron